  "seed": "The third guide of the Components track, and the part everybody gets wrong: a copy cannot simply be edited. What is inside it belongs to the original, so the way in is a knob the ORIGINAL offers. The order of the steps is the model: the original decides what is adjustable, the copy answers, and the answer survives the next edit to the original because it is written back over the top after the refill. The original lives in the Library (2026-10-04), so the property is added in Edit Original and the walk comes back with Done.",
